WEBVTT

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.920
(Vogel) It is not lost

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.240
on those of us in leadership that
we are currently a world divided.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.800
Each day brings talk
of another conspiracy.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.480
Each hour another dark whisper.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.280
These whispers have only
increased in recent days

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.080
with the addition of
a third candidate.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:32.080
There is only one way to
leave absolutely no doubt

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.760
that a worthy candidate
exists amongst

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.120
the three you have
been presented.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.640
(crowd murmuring)

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.640
(menacing music playing)

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.320
(crowd gasps)

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:59.800
As every schoolboy and girl knows,

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:06.080
the Qilin is the purest of
creatures in our wonderful
magical world.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.560
It cannot be deceived.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.000
(soft gasps)

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.560
Let the Qilin unite us.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:14.560
(menacing music continues)

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:24.200
(crowd cheering in distance)

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.920
(crowd chanting) Santos!
Santos! Santos!

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:43.720
Santos! Santos! Santos!

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:47.280
Santos! Santos! Santos!

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.280
(tense music playing)

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.680
(swift whoosh)

00:01:59.000 --> 00:01:59.960
Come.

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.200
-(huffs) -(whispering)
Where to, next?

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.400
(whispering) Uh, this
is where I leave you.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.160
I'm... I'm sorry, you're what?

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.600
Leaving me?

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.200
I have to meet someone else, Mr.
Kowalski.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:15.960
Not to worry...

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.280
you'll be perfectly safe.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:21.360
(magical music playing)

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.520
You don't have the Qilin.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:27.320
Feel free to drop the case at
the first hint of trouble.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.000
One other thing, if you
don't mind me saying.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.480
You should stop doubting yourself.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.320
You have something most men go
their entire lives without.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.760
Do you know what that is?

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.440
A heart that is full.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:44.200
Only a truly brave man

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:49.040
could open himself up so honestly
and completely, as you do.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.000
(swift whoosh)

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.680
(suspenseful music playing)

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.440
(crowd continues
chanting in distance)

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.720
(ominous music plays)

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.120
(crowd chanting) Santos!
Santos! Santos!

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:20.920
Santos! Santos! Santos!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.040
Santos! Santos! Santos!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.040
(tense music playing)

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.080
(creatures chirping)

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.000
(music crescendoing)

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.560
(bells jingle)

00:03:58.560 --> 00:03:59.520
(all grunting)

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.200
(creatures chirping)

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.080
(wizard) Cases, please.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.080
(tense music playing)

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:49.920
(Jacob) Hey, fellas.

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.280
(both grunt)

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.040
(Jacob exclaims)

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.080
Woo-hoo-hoo.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.720
(chuckles) He's angry.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:18.040
Wait. Open them, make
sure it's in there.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.080
Idiots.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.040
(muffled banging)

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:21.480
(muffled grunting)

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.640
(suspenseful music playing)

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.160
(buckles click)

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.200
(chirring)

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:59.600
(magical music playing)

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.360
(rumbling)

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:16.320
(all yelping)

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.000
(yelling)

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:23.520
(books snarling)

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:24.680
(grunting and groaning)

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:30.480
(all yelping)

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.040
(chuckles)

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.640
-(books snarling) -(grunting)

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.440
(huffs)

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:43.440
(tense music playing)

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.000
-(thump) -(wizard 1 grunts)

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.760
-(thump) -(wizards grunt)

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.920
How long does he have?

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.800
(phoenix cries)

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.800
(mysterious music playing)

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:19.400
(wistful music playing)

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.960
(horn blaring in distance)

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.360
(crowd chattering)

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.440
Here. Hey. Hi.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:44.760
You're in danger, all right?

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:46.360
-You need to leave. -Well...

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.880
I can't... I can't go, okay?

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.280
I can't come home.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.680
It's too late for me, all right?

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:54.960
Some mistakes, they're just too
big.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:55.920
(breathing shakily)

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:56.960
Can you listen to me?

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.160
There's no time. I was followed.

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:02.720
I gave 'em the slip, but it won't
be long before they find me.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.280
-They're gonna find us.
-I don't care.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.960
All I got is us.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.440
I make no sense without us.

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:11.240
Jacob, what? Come on... (panting)

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.200
I don't love you anymore.
Just get outta here.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.520
You're the worst liar in the
world, Queenie Goldstein.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.040
(bells jingling)

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:18.160
You hear that?

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.680
What? No.

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.240
That's a sign.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:22.480
Oh, man.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.400
-Oh, come on. -Come here, come
here.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.080
Close your eyes.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.760
Please close your eyes.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.160
You know what Dumbledore said to
me?

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.720
No.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.560
He said that I got a full heart.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:41.800
He's wrong.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:44.960
I'm always gonna have
room in there for you.

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.360
-Yeah? -Yeah.

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:48.720
You know it.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.040
Look at me.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.360
Queenie Goldstein.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.680
(bells continue jingling)

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:03.360
(Queenie sighs)

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.360
(dramatic music playing)

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.320
(crowd chattering)

